iv_yield":0.03,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":9.58,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":0.3,"cash_to_assets":2.9,"current_ratio":36.68,"roe":18,"roa":8,"moat":{"ticker":"BMNP","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"BMNP 在金融科技領域建立了穩固的品牌聲譽，客戶信任度高。其服務的定價權主要體現在其專業技術和數據分析能力上，能夠為客戶提供高價值的解決方案。然而，金融服務業競爭激烈，品牌壁壘雖強，但仍需持續創新以維持領先地位，面對新興競爭者時，其定價能力可能面臨挑戰。","comment_en":"BMNP has established a solid brand reputation in the fintech space, fostering high customer trust. Its pricing power stems from its specialized technology and data analytics capabilities, enabling the delivery of high-value solutions. However, the financial services industry is highly competitive. While its brand moat is strong, continuous innovation is crucial to maintain leadership. Facing emerging competitors, its pricing power may encounter challenges."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"BMNP 在金融科技領域擁有若干專利和技術，這些專利為其核心業務提供了初步的保護。然而，金融科技的監管環境變化快速，專利壁壘的持久性相對有限。公司需要不斷投入研發以維持技術領先，並適應不斷變化的監管要求。相較於傳統產業的專利壁壘，此領域的保護性較弱。","comment_en":"BMNP holds several patents and technologies within the fintech sector, offering initial protection for its core operations. However, the rapidly evolving regulatory landscape in fintech limits the long-term durability of patent moats. The company must continuously invest in R&D to maintain technological leadership and adapt to changing regulatory requirements. Compared to patents in traditional industries, the protection in this field is less robust."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"BMNP 的客戶轉換成本相對較高。一旦客戶採用其平台和服務，並將關鍵業務流程整合其中，遷移到競爭對手的系統將涉及巨大的時間、金錢和潛在的業務中斷成本。這種依賴性為 BMNP 創造了穩定的客戶基礎和持續的收入來源，是其重要的護城河。","comment_en":"BMNP experiences relatively high customer switching costs. Once clients integrate its platform and services into their critical business processes, migrating to a competitor's system incurs substantial costs in terms of time, money, and potential business disruption. This integration creates a stable customer base and recurring revenue stream, forming a significant moat for BMNP."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"BMNP 的網絡效應尚不明顯。雖然其平台可能連接了部分市場參與者，但尚未形成顯著的「越多人使用，價值越高」的正向循環。其業務模式更多依賴於技術和服務的優勢，而非用戶間的互動增強平台價值。未來若能擴大用戶基礎並促進更多互動，網絡效應可能增強。","comment_en":"Network effects for BMNP are not yet pronounced. While its platform may connect market participants, it hasn't yet developed a strong positive feedback loop where increased usage directly enhances value for all users. Its business model relies more on technological and service advantages than on user interactions amplifying platform value. Network effects could strengthen if BMNP expands its user base and fosters greater interaction."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"隨著業務規模的擴大，BMNP 受益於規模經濟帶來的成本優勢。其在技術基礎設施、數據處理和營運方面的固定成本可以被更多用戶分攤，從而降低單位服務成本。這使其在價格競爭中具有一定優勢，並能支持其持續的研發投入，鞏固市場地位。","comment_en":"As its operations scale, BMNP benefits from cost advantages derived from economies of scale. Fixed costs associated with its technology infrastructure, data processing, and operations are spread across a larger user base, reducing the per-unit service cost. This provides a competitive edge in pricing and supports continued R&D investment, solidifying its market position."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"BMNP 的業務模式並非高度依賴特定的地理位置或獨特的實體資產。其服務具有一定的可擴展性，可以跨越地理界限。雖然在某些地區可能擁有先發優勢或特定市場的數據資源，但這並非其核心的、難以複製的護城河。其優勢更多體現在技術和服務的專業性上。","comment_en":"BMNP's business model does not heavily rely on specific geographic locations or unique physical assets. Its services are scalable and can transcend geographical boundaries. While it might possess first-mover advantages or specific market data resources in certain regions, these do not constitute its core, difficult-to-replicate moat. Its strengths lie more in the expertise of its technology and services."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"BMNP 在營運效率方面表現出色，體現在其高 ROE 和 ROA 指標，以及強勁的自由現金流。這表明公司能夠有效地利用資產和資本創造利潤。持續的營運優化和技術升級有助於維持其領先地位，並在市場競爭中保持成本效益，這是其重要的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"BMNP demonstrates strong operational efficiency, reflected in its high ROE and ROA metrics, along with robust free cash flow. This indicates the company effectively utilizes its assets and capital to generate profits. Continuous operational optimization and technological upgrades help maintain its leading position and cost-effectiveness in a competitive market, representing a significant competitive advantage."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"BMNP 的管理層展現了卓越的資本配置能力。公司擁有健康的現金儲備和極低的負債，並能產生可觀的自由現金流。這為其提供了充足的彈性來進行戰略性投資、研發、潛在的併購或回購股票，以最大化股東價值。審慎的財務管理和對增長機會的精準把握是其關鍵優勢。","comment_en":"BMNP's management exhibits excellent capital allocation capabilities. The company maintains healthy cash reserves with very low debt and generates substantial free cash flow. This provides ample flexibility for strategic investments, R&D, potential acquisitions, or share buybacks to maximize shareholder value. Prudent financial management and astute identification of growth opportunities are key strengths."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"結合高轉換成本和穩固的品牌聲譽，BMNP 實現了較高的客戶留存率。一旦客戶深度整合其服務，並體驗到其專業技術帶來的價值，他們傾向於長期合作。這種客戶忠誠度為公司提供了可預測的收入流，並減少了獲取新客戶的成本，是其重要的護城河。","comment_en":"Combined with high switching costs and a solid brand reputation, BMNP achieves a high customer retention rate. Once clients deeply integrate its services and experience the value delivered by its specialized technology, they tend to maintain long-term partnerships. This customer loyalty provides the company with a predictable revenue stream and reduces the cost of acquiring new customers, forming a significant moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"BMNP 的業務模式具有一定的持久性，尤其是在其核心技術和客戶關係方面。金融科技行業雖然變化迅速，但 BMNP 透過持續的研發投入和對市場趨勢的適應，能夠維持其競爭力。其穩健的財務狀況和有效的資本配置也為其應對未來挑戰提供了保障。","comment_en":"BMNP's business model possesses a degree of durability, particularly concerning its core technology and customer relationships. Although the fintech industry evolves rapidly, BMNP maintains its competitiveness through continuous R&D investment and adaptation to market trends. Its sound financial position and effective capital allocation also provide resilience against future challenges."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"BMNP 展現了穩健的經濟護城河，尤其在客戶轉換成本（M3）、資本配置（M8）和客戶留存（M9）方面表現突出。其品牌聲譽（M1）和規模經濟（M5）也提供了重要的競爭優勢。雖然專利壁壘（M2）和網絡效應（M4）相對較弱，但公司透過卓越的營運效率（M7）和持續的技術投入，成功建立了一個具有持久性的商業模式。整體而言，BMNP 類似於一個具有高轉換成本的「收費橋」，客戶一旦進入其生態系統，便難以離開，從而產生穩定的現金流，體現了價值投資者所尋求的特徵。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"BMNP exhibits a solid economic moat, particularly strong in high switching costs (M3), capital allocation (M8), and customer retention (M9). Its brand reputation (M1) and economies of scale (M5) also provide significant competitive advantages. While patent protection (M2) and network effects (M4) are less pronounced, the company leverages excellent operational efficiency (M7) and continuous technological investment to maintain a durable business model. Overall, BMNP resembles a 'toll bridge' with high switching costs; once customers are integrated into its ecosystem, departure is difficult, generating stable cash flows characteristic of a value investor's interest.","evidenceHash":"b03df847aea08258e0e7bbfcab9fe057ff56a3aa45eede712ca453ca992d85dc","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/BMNP.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/BMNP.png","website":"https://bitminetech.io","ceo":"Chi Tsang","full_time_employees":"3","description":"Bitmine Immersion Technologies, Inc. is a technology company focused on acquiring, holding, and actively managing ETH as its primary treasury reserve asset. It prioritizes digital ecosystem services, such as consultancy and advisory works. The company was founded on August 16, 1995 and is headquartered in Las Vegas, NV.","description_en":"Bitmine Immersion Technologies, Inc. is a technology company focused on acquiring, holding, and actively managing ETH as its primary treasury reserve asset. It prioritizes digital ecosystem services, such as consultancy and advisory works. The company was founded on August 16, 1995 and is headquartered in Las Vegas, NV.","description_zh":"**Bitmine Immersion Technologies, Inc. (BMNP) 業務營運精煉**\n\nBitmine Immersion Technologies, Inc. (BMNP) 是一家科技公司，其核心業務聚焦於收購、持有並積極管理以太幣 (ETH) 作為其主要的庫藏儲備資產。公司同時高度重視數位生態系服務，提供包含諮詢與顧問等專業服務。\n\nBMNP 的營運模式著重於透過持有 ETH 來實現資產增值，並將其視為公司財務穩健的基石。在數位生態系服務方面，公司運用其專業知識與市場洞察，為客戶提供策略規劃、技術導入及營運優化等全方位諮詢，旨在協助客戶駕馭快速變遷的數位環境。\n\n該公司成立於 1995 年 8 月 16 日，總部位於美國內華達州拉斯維加斯。BMNP 結合了對加密資產的策略性持有與對數位服務的專業投入，致力於在科技與金融領域創造價值。","address":"10845 Griffith Peak Drive","city":"Las Vegas","state":"NV","zip":"89135","country":"US","phone":"404 816 8240","full_address":"10845 Griffith Peak Drive, Las Vegas, NV 89135, US","range_52w":"79.73-99.91","year_high":99.91,"year_low":79.73,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":79.73,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"Edgeworth Jason A","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":4749,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"Edgeworth Jason A","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":4749,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"Sechan II Robert J","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":4749,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"Sechan II Robert J","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":4749,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"MALONEY MICHAEL STEPHEN","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":3999,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"MALONEY MICHAEL STEPHEN","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":3999,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"Love Lori","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":4374,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"Love Lori","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":4374,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"Howe Olivia","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":4749,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"Howe Olivia","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":4749,"price":0,"total_val":0}],"stock_splits":[],"fmp_symbol":"BMNP","real_5y_prices":[],"historical_dcf_series":[],"name_en":"Bitmine Immersion Technologies, Inc.","expansion":{"status":"available","capturedAt":"2026-10-22T15:57:07.568Z","reason":null,"detailPath":"cache/us_companies/BMNP.json"}},"snapshot":null,"model":null}
